     "action_step_id": "s4c",
     "approved_version": "The open-shift offer with date, start and end time and game exactly as checked by the manager in s4b, sent once to the listed qualified, available dealers in the scheduling app; any change needs a new check.",
     "approval_step_id": "s4b",
     "approver": "gambling manager"
    }
   ],
   "design": "A screen lists dealers rostered but not clocked in, from the time clock and the roster, instead of comparing them by hand. When a dealer is missing, the manager checks the open shift and releases it in the scheduling app to qualified, available dealers, and confirms the first acceptance, instead of phoning down the list. Floor walks, the rotation chart, briefings, moving dealers and the log stay with the manager. Offers go by qualification and availability only, not by performance, and the use is agreed with the works council.",
   "previous_blocker": "Gaps were found on paper and substitutes phoned one by one.",
   "enabler_now": "Time clock and roster comparison and open-shift offers.",
   "still_hard": "Last-minute absences on busy nights.",
   "human_edge": "Knowing which dealer can take a high-stakes table.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
   },
   "altitude": "Less phoning; floor judgement stays.",
